From 8a2ae4fa5a1ee8f598d009d607ebb2d47d11ffc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:27:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(calendar): working days per month, used by forecast

- src/domain/calendar.js: workingDays(year, month, holidays) = Mon-Fri minus
  holidays (weekend holidays and duplicates are not subtracted twice),
  month helpers, current month by Europe/Kyiv
- forecast.js: meals use the working days of the forecast month instead of
  the fixed 21 (resolveWorkingDays); POST /forecast accepts optional month
  and returns calendar { month, workingDays }
- Unit tests: February, leap year, holiday on a weekend, Kyiv month boundary

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UCQDF21NQ2cPLQwHMwH7Qz
